fit_content = true
text = "The far side of the freezer and the only way home. A concrete apron under a half-raised bay door, one painted extraction zone marked on the floor, a dead forklift and stacked pallets for whatever cover they're worth. Stand in the zone and hold for eight seconds — the extract chime rings through every room in the building, and the last stretch to this door becomes the tensest walk of the run. Mid-grade loot sits here too, tempting one more pickup before you commit."
